## Project Overview

This project focuses on analysing Airbnb listing data and guest review activity to understand market distribution, advertised pricing, property characteristics, host performance indicators and review trends.

The project uses Python for data preparation and quality assessment, and Microsoft Power BI for data modelling, DAX calculations, KPI development and interactive dashboard reporting.

The objective is to transform raw Airbnb data into meaningful insights that can support market understanding and data-driven business decisions.

## Project Objectives

- Analyse Airbnb listing distribution across different cities.
- Examine advertised listing prices and property characteristics.
- Compare pricing patterns within individual local markets.
- Evaluate available host response and acceptance indicators.
- Analyse review activity and trends over time.
- Examine aggregate listing-level review scores.
- Develop interactive Power BI dashboards.
- Provide evidence-based findings and recommendations.

