## Dataset Overview

The project uses two primary datasets:

| Dataset | Records | Fields |
|---|---:|---:|
| Listings | 279,712 | 33 original columns |
| Reviews | 5,373,143 | 4 columns |

The Reviews dataset contains listing IDs, review IDs, reviewer IDs and review dates.

## Data Preparation and Cleaning

Python was used to prepare and validate the datasets.

Key preparation activities included:

- Importing and inspecting the source datasets.
- Handling file encoding issues.
- Checking missing values and duplicate records.
- Validating listing identifiers.
- Converting review dates into valid date formats.
- Identifying unusual price, capacity and booking-rule values.
- Creating data-quality flags.
- Preparing analytical subsets for pricing, capacity and booking-rule analysis.
- Processing the large Reviews dataset in chunks.

